&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today, SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of making life multiplanetary and expanding consciousness to the stars.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SpaceXSI is building Super Intelligence to help humanity understand the universe. Our teams are building the full Super Intelligence stack: from our Colossus supercomputers, to Grok models, to our suite of applications, including Grok Bot, Grok Build, Grok Imagine, Grok Voice, and X. We&#39;re creating a powerful flywheel where more compute trains better models, better models power more useful products, and what we learn from people using those products shapes what we build next.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Head of Independent Agencies, you will own our independent and performance agency portfolio and third-party partnerships. You will drive revenue growth through strategic relationships, education, and ideation directly with agencies — and own a focused set of partner relationships that help agencies and sellers evaluate and scale the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will develop strategic relationships across critical indy and performance agencies. You will partner with Client Partners, Mid-Market sales, product/measurement, and broader agency leadership to deliver a cohesive engagement plan. You will also arm agencies with the knowledge and tools to innovate and sell through ideas featuring X — including measurement guidance via partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior individual-contributor role with commercial influence; the remit may grow over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency Portfolio:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase revenue across agency-driven accounts and unlock new advertisers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted partnerships, expand and deepen relationships, and facilitate active communication between agencies and X&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Client Partners and Mid-Market sales on agency support plans, growth strategies, and day-to-day matters to remove blockers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver educational programs (Lunch &amp;amp; Learns, product updates, bootcamp-style training) on products, brand safety, measurement, and best practices for advertising on X&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate how and why people use X to help marketers identify and inspire authentic uses of X for their brands and clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure agency voice, opinions, ideas, and feedback are conveyed back to Marketing, Product, and Measurement — including input on advertiser insights and needs for new products, features, and solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop first-class programs that uplevel creative and commercial thinking and deliver positive business impact for agency clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discover, catalog, and create great X usage stories that shape how agencies and brands understand X&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with holding-company / Big 6 agency leads where coverage overlaps, while remaining the dedicated indy/performance owner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic 3P Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own and grow the third-party measurement partner portfolio; build senior relationships and plans aligned to X’s product and commercial priorities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate measurement capabilities into clear value for partners and practical guidance for agencies and sellers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive joint go-to-market with partners and cross-functional teammates; prioritize highest-impact work and keep partner vs. agency messaging coordinated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8–12+ years experience in an agency, media sales, agency development, or adjacent commercial partnership role — with meaningful exposure to independent and/or performance agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to think strategically about agencies, social/digital platforms, and/or measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in social media platforms and how agencies plan, buy, and measure brand + performance media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client-facing, sales, and commercial skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the indy/performance agency landscape and (ideally) relationships across it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning or scaling strategic partner relationships (measurement, technology, media, or adjacent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort leading discussions with agencies and partners&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to partner within cross-functional teams, consult, and bring ideas to the table&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build internal networks and get things done through collaboration across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter who takes initiative, balances quick turnaround with longer-term strategy, and is comfortable with ambiguity and a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alignment to X’s vision and core values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships across indy/performance agencies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with agency support plans / joint business planning alongside sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background spanning both brand and performance agency models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work at a major social/digital platform, a performance agency, or a measurement partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPENSATION AND BENEFITS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;$127,000 - $220,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Base salary is just one part of our total rewards package at SpaceXSI, which also includes equity, comprehensive medical, vision, and dental coverage, access to a 401(k) retirement plan, short &amp;amp; long-term disability insurance, life insurance, and various other discounts and perks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITAR REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To conform to U.S. Government export regulations, applicant must be a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful, permanent resident (aka green card holder), (iii) Refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) Asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, or be eligible to obtain the required authorizations from the U.S. Department of State. Learn more about the ITAR&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pmddtc.state.gov/?id=ddtc_kb_article_page&amp;amp;sys_id=24d528fddbfc930044f9ff621f961987&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SpaceXSI is an equal opportunity employer. For details on data processing, view our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://x.ai/legal/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today, SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of making life multiplanetary and expanding consciousness to the stars.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SpaceXSI is building Super Intelligence to help humanity understand the universe. Our teams are building the full Super Intelligence stack: from our Colossus supercomputers, to Grok models, to our suite of applications, including Grok Bot, Grok Build, Grok Imagine, Grok Voice, and X. We&#39;re creating a powerful flywheel where more compute trains better models, better models power more useful products, and what we learn from people using those products shapes what we build next.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI TUTOR, AMHARIC - TEMPORARY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will help train and refine Grok&#39;s voice and language capabilities in Amharic. Your expertise will directly shape how Grok speaks and understands Amharic, from pronunciation and natural phrasing to cultural nuance. You will see your work show up in a product used by people around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annotate, label, and provide feedback on multilingual audio clips, voice recordings, and speech samples using proprietary tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate and localize text (UI copy, prompts, responses, and other content) from English into Amharic, with attention to accuracy, natural phrasing, and cultural fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help produce clear, natural audio data that accurately captures linguistic and prosodic details such as intonation, rhythm, and accent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with technical staff to refine annotation guidelines and tools for handling accents, background noise, speech variation, and multilingual audio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POSITION DETAILS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;temporary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; position with SpaceXSI, for the length of time as stated, and is subject to change with minimal notice as business needs dictate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LENGTH OF POSITION: 6 months (extensions or conversion to a permanent role may be available based on business needs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LOCATION: Remote (United States, United Kingdom, Canada, and Australia); for US-based candidates, please note that we are unable to hire in Wyoming and Illinois at this time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Amharic at CEFR C1 level or higher&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English proficiency at CEFR B2 level or higher&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native proficiency in Amharic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English proficiency at CEFR C1 level or higher&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in one or more of the following areas:&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced transcription or audio annotation, with strong attention to accents, prosody, disfluencies, and variable recording quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translation or localization work (especially UI, product copy, or conversational text) between English and Amharic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voice recording, voice acting, podcasting, or related audio production that demonstrates clear delivery and attention to sound quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in linguistics, phonetics, speech sciences, or hands-on work with speech/audio datasets and AI training data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role may be offered as a full-time or part-time position depending on role/business needs and candidate availability; full-time positions are preferred and require working standard business hours in your local time zone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are unable to provide visa sponsorship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be willing to travel to a SpaceXSI site&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPENSATION AND BENEFITS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;US-based candidates: $35/hour - $45/hour depending on factors including relevant experience, skills, education, geographic location, and qualifications. International candidates: Information will be provided to you during the recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits vary based on employment type, location, and jurisdiction. Benefits for eligible US-based positions include health insurance, 401(k) plan, and paid sick leave. Specific details and role-specific information will be provided to you during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SpaceXSI is an equal opportunity employer. For details on data processing, view our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://x.ai/legal/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;SpaceX was founded under the belief that a future where humanity is out exploring the stars is fundamentally more exciting than one where we are not. Today, SpaceX is actively developing the technologies to make this possible, with the ultimate goal of making life multiplanetary and expanding consciousness to the stars.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SpaceXSI is building Super Intelligence to help humanity understand the universe. Our teams are building the full Super Intelligence stack: from our Colossus supercomputers, to Grok models, to our suite of applications, including Grok Bot, Grok Build, Grok Imagine, Grok Voice, and X. We&#39;re creating a powerful flywheel where more compute trains better models, better models power more useful products, and what we learn from people using those products shapes what we build next.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will help enhance Grok by providing high-quality data annotations, labels, and&amp;nbsp;inputs focused on applied mathematics. You will draw on your expertise in areas such as numerical analysis and scientific computing, ordinary and partial differential equations, probability and applied statistics, computational linear algebra, and mathematical physics or mathematical biology to evaluate model outputs, identify modeling errors or numerical issues, and produce clear, rigorous solutions and explanations. This role requires strong mathematical writing skills, attention to precision, and the ability to maintain logical consistency throughout complex mathematical arguments. Your work will help train Grok to distinguish flawed or inadequately justified approaches from solutions that are mathematically sound, accurately modeled, and practically applicable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate model outputs, independently verify mathematical solutions, identify subtle errors in reasoning, modelling, or numerical computations, and produce clear, rigorous, and technically sound solutions and explanations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use proprietary software applications to annotate and label data for designated projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the delivery of high-quality, accurate, and well-curated datasets that meet project standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with technical teams to develop and train new tasks, contributing to the successful development and implementation of innovative technologies and initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with technical staff to improve the design, functionality, and efficiency of annotation tools and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve problems across applied mathematics domains aligned with your expertise, including probability, statistics, numerical analysis, optimization, operations research, dynamical systems, data modeling, and related fields. Develop detailed solutions and critically evaluate AI-generated responses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret, analyze, and execute tasks accurately in accordance with established guidelines and project requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet one of the following criteria:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A master’s degree or PhD in mathematics, with a specialization in an applied mathematics subfield; or&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A medal in the International Mathematical Olympiad (IMO) or a comparable high-level mathematics competition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English proficiency at CEFR C1 level or higher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peer-reviewed publications in applied mathematics in reputable scientific journals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in AI tutoring, AI model evaluation, or related applications of artificial intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teaching experience, particularly at the college or university level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong research skills, including the ability to navigate diverse information resources, academic databases, and technical literature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, interpersonal, analytical, and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to exercise sound independent judgment when working with limited information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong interest in technological advancement, innovation, and emerging technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LOCATION AND OTHER EXPECTATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a remote role which may be performed from the following countries:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;United States&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;United Kingdom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Canada&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Australia&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;India&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role may be offered as a full-time or part-time position, depending on role / business needs and candidate availability. Full-time positions are preferred and require working standard business hours in your local time zone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positions are typically offered as fixed-term employment contracts of 6 months. Extensions or conversion to a permanent role may be available based on business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For US-based candidates, please note that we are unable to hire in Wyoming and Illinois at this time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are unable to provide visa sponsorship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to a SpaceXSI site may be required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPENSATION AND BENEFITS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;US-based candidates: $45/hour - $75/hour depending on factors including relevant experience, skills, education, geographic location, and qualifications. International candidates: Information will be provided to you during the recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits vary based on employment type, location, and jurisdiction. Benefits for eligible US-based positions include health insurance, 401(k) plan, and paid sick leave. Specific details and role-specific information will be provided to you during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SpaceXSI is an equal opportunity employer. For details on data processing, view our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://x.ai/legal/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

