&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in computer science, cybersecurity, or scientific discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in application security, with a focus on code security practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python or Rust, and secure coding practices in these languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
