&lt;p&gt;Join the High Power Engineering team supporting SpaceXSI to design, build, operate, and maintain electrical infrastructure for AI training campuses. As a Civil Engineer on the Battery Storage team, you will work with a small on-site team to scale high-capacity power systems on a schedule set by compute demand. The position is based in Memphis, TN, with potential travel to other sites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own civil and site design for the battery storage plant: pads, foundations, grading, drainage, access roads, fire lanes, and equipment yards coordinated with electrical collection and NFPA 855 spacing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the fire and life-safety case with civil provisions: water supply, hydrant layout, deflagration venting clearances, and emergency vehicle access for AHJ review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate seismic and severe-weather (tornado/high-wind) structural design basis for storage blocks, transformers, and equipment supports with structural engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce issued-for-construction civil packages: site plans, sections, details, specifications, and bid support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve field RFIs, submittals, and installation quality issues during construction of the storage yard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate underground electrical duct banks, oil containment, and grounding grid civil interfaces with Design and Ops/Build engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain as-built civil records for the storage plant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in civil engineering, structural engineering, or another engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of civil or structural design experience on industrial, energy, or data center sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Engineering (PE) license or intention to actively seek a PE license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NFPA 855 or energy-storage site civil experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with seismic qualification and severe-weather hardening of outdoor electrical equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AutoCAD Civil 3D or equivalent site-design software experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating civil packages with medium-voltage collection and fire-protection design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defending a design to an authority having jurisdiction&lt;/li&gt;
