&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-functional alignment on go-to-market motions, packaging, positioning, and value propositions for the Ads business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, mentor, and develop high-performing talent in marketing, analytics, and enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
