&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of progressive experience in growth marketing, digital advertising, measurement/analytics, or sales enablement, with significant time spent in advertising or social media platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership experience managing marketing and/or analytics teams in a high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in advertising measurement, attribution, experimentation, and performance analytics; demonstrated ability to convert insights into revenue-driving actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record at prominent advertising platforms, social media companies, or ad-tech organizations (e.g., Meta, Google, TikTok, Snap, LinkedIn, Amazon Ads, or equivalent).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional data fluency and comfort working with large-scale datasets, BI tools, and statistical concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building sales enablement programs that demonstrably improve win rates, deal size, or advertiser retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills; ability to influence senior leaders and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with a bias for action and a results-oriented mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required; advanced degree (MBA or quantitative field) preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
