&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a Director-level or equivalent role supporting a significant advertising revenue business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with privacy-centric measurement, multi-touch attribution, media mix modeling, or advanced experimentation platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in New York or other major advertising hubs with strong agency and brand relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
