&lt;p&gt;As an Operations Electrician, you will keep in-service substations, distribution, and campus power facilities running. This is an operating-plant job: inspect, maintain, switch, and restore equipment so load stays up. You will work with energized medium- and high-voltage systems under established safety standards, perform switching and operations up to 161 kV, and respond to faults and call-outs. This position is based in Memphis, TN.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate, inspect, maintain, and repair in-service substation and campus electrical equipment, including breakers, transformers, switches, relays, buswork, control systems, and station batteries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform medium-voltage switching and operations up to 161 kV: write or follow switching orders, isolate and de-energize equipment, apply grounds, verify zero energy, and restore equipment to service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own routine maintenance on medium- and high-voltage operating systems: inspections, lubrication, oil levels, heaters, lights, and connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to outages, faults, alarms, and call-outs; restore service and document what happened.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct electrical testing on in-service equipment (voltmeters, ohmmeters, ammeters, insulation megger) and assist with relay, transformer, and circuit breaker tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read and interpret one-lines, schematics, wiring diagrams, and switching orders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot electrical, mechanical, and control issues on running plant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow lockout/tagout (LOTO), grounding, clearance procedures, and PPE requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate switching and clearances with operators, engineers, and utility crews during planned and emergency outages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document work performed, test results, and observations; keep operating records current.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate company vehicles and specialized equipment; inspect and store personal protective equipment (PPE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform similar or less skilled incidental duties as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
