&lt;li&gt;Culinary degree and 4+ years of experience in the food service industry; OR 6+ years of experience in the food service industry in lieu of a degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in a multi-outlet operation facility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culinary degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in use of Microsoft Office and Outlook software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a corporate environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with high volume or batch cooking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a group of 20 or more team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kitchen and or dining area renovation/construction experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge of kitchen equipment and safe kitchen operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
