&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High school diploma or equivalency certificate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience in maintenance, facilities, or a hands-on role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mechanical, electrical, or plumbing systems&lt;/li&gt;
