&lt;li&gt;Conduct maintenance of assigned interior and exterior areas, including painting, patching walls, replacing ceiling/flooring tiles and carpet, fixtures, and roofing systems as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform inspections and repairs to walls, floors, installed fixtures, doors/hardware, and building envelope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to work tickets for leaks, HVAC issues, electrical problems, and general break/fix; complete preventive maintenance on assigned assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aid janitorial and site staff with general support, including moving furniture and equipment, disposing of construction waste, and set-up and tear-down of special event areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support campus-wide operations and maintenance programs as assigned by facilities leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate forklifts, scissor lifts, and boom lifts when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open, track, and resolve electronic work tickets in the site work-order system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to proper safety guidelines at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
