&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;Fiber Technician III at SpaceXSI&#39;s Memphis data center, you will take ownership of fiber optic infrastructure projects and lead a team of technicians in installing, maintaining, and optimizing high-performance network connectivity. You’ll combine deep technical expertise with leadership skills to ensure the highest standards of quality, safety, and uptime in a fast-paced, hyperscale environment. Working onsite with passionate teams, you’ll drive complex fiber deployments, mentor junior technicians, troubleshoot critical issues, and help build the robust backbone that powers SpaceXSI&#39;s mission to accelerate human scientific discovery through AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
