&lt;li&gt;Ensure a safe, productive, and high-quality work environment for the entire team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the development of sensor indicators and conduct timely inspections to maintain optimal fiber optic system performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot, resolve, repair, and install complex fiber optics systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Examine and replace faulty or aging fiber optic cables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize and optimize scheduled maintenance routines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead fiber splicing activities and resolve fiber optic problem areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and maintain signal strength across devices and infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulate, maintain, and improve system records, documentation, and system designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical guidance, training, and quality assurance for all fiber-related work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
