&lt;li&gt;Perform root-cause analysis on inventory variances and recommend/implement corrective actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate reports and dashboards on inventory metrics, turnover, aging, accuracy, and KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and analyze cycle count programs; reconcile physical vs. system inventory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and improve data quality in ERP/WMS systems; ensure lot/serial and location traceability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with operations, procurement, commissioning, and finance on inventory planning, forecasting, and material flow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and drive process improvements for receiving, storage, kitting, issuance, and staging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on high-value assets and critical spare parts to support 24/7 operations&lt;/li&gt;
