&lt;li&gt;Experience writing and operating playbooks, runbooks, or standard operating procedures, methods of procedure, emergency operations procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in scripting (Python, Bash) for automation and analysis, plus general experience in at least one systems language (C, C++, Java, Go, Rust, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work collaboratively with cross-functional, cross-country, multi-disciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
