&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day site sustainment operations, including resolving issues impacting rack-level compute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disposition daily issues across both Site Ops (compute) and Fac Ops (power and cooling)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead acceptance and deployment testing campaigns to bring new data halls fully online&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop production scripts and automation for new data hall bring-up, and build the automation behind the NOC Bot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain manufacturing-planning-style work instructions so technicians work more efficiently and safely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and document the live, changing state of data hall operation as new halls come online&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable Site Ops and Fac Ops technicians to do their jobs more efficiently and safely to increase GPU uptime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
