&lt;li&gt;Experience with leading studies that significantly improve neural network capabilities and performance through better data or modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to deliver optimal end-to-end user experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on contributor with initiative, excellence, strong work ethic, prioritization skills, and excellent communication&lt;/li&gt;
