&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize the distributed training infrastructure and software for speech-language models in JAX and PyTorch, including the systems that run supervised fine-tuning and reinforcement learning at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build automated evaluation and testing systems that measure accuracy, audio quality, latency, and real-time performance, plus the experimentation infrastructure used to validate every model release&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate voice models into production applications and real-time services, write the technical specifications for spoken interactions, and own deployment from prototype to global scale with a focus on stability, low latency, and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profile and optimize system performance across training and inference, including throughput, latency, memory use, and compute efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in computer science, software engineering, computer engineering, electrical engineering, or another engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and running large-scale distributed training and inference systems on Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing and optimizing model training and inference software in JAX or PyTorch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building automated testing, evaluation, and A/B experimentation pipelines for production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level Python, writing clean, efficient, production-quality code for large-scale systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building distributed data processing systems with tools like Spark and Ray&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, self-driven attitude and the ability to deliver in a fast-paced, high-caliber team&lt;/li&gt;
