&lt;li&gt;Maintain and improve the systems that serve our existing customers while designing and shipping new products that expand what the platform can do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design clean, reliable, well-abstracted solutions to problems of scale, correctness, and developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
