&lt;p&gt;Agencies decide what gets planned, pitched, and bought. This role exists to make X the default recommendation inside those rooms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You own the agency system and the commercial architecture for Global Brands across APAC. That means holding-company and regional leadership in Singapore and India — and, as a hiring requirement, the Business Directors, Client Directors, and Account Directors who write the plans and clear the buys. A C-suite network without working-level relationships is not sufficient for this role. You will structure commercial deals, navigate complex agency structures, and create the conditions for the sales tea to win more spend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior individual-contributor role. You will operate independently, set your own map, and be accountable for agency-sourced revenue influence and partnership quality. You will work as a peer with the Global Brand sales team — close partnership, distinct ownership. This role reports to the Head of Global Brands, APAC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run the agency development plan for Global Brands across APAC — covering holding companies, regional hubs in Singapore and India, operating companies, and key independents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure and negotiate commercial deals with agencies: trading agreements, partnership frameworks, incentives, joint business plans, and other constructs that lock in commitment and unlock spend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate complex agency structures — holdco vs. opco, regional vs. local P&amp;amp;Ls, media vs. creative vs. social specialists, and split decision rights between Singapore regional teams and in-market India / SEA offices. Know who decides, who influences, who executes, and how a regional recommendation dies or ships in-market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary trusted advisor to priority agencies. Educate teams on X products, audiences, creative, brand safety, and measurement. Arm them to recommend X to their brand clients without you in the room&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Client Partners and market teams to convert agency relationships into live campaigns, larger statements of work, and multi-market commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify whitespace: agencies and pods that should be recommending X and currently are not. Open those doors and create a path to revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent X at agency town halls, leadership forums, holding-company reviews, industry events, and in-market working sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track partnership health and commercial performance. Course-correct quickly. Do not wait for a quarterly review to find out a key agency has gone quiet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BASIC QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in media sales, agency development, or senior agency-side commercial/client leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear record of driving revenue through agency partnerships in APAC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter who runs independently. You do not need a playbook handed to you. You build one, socialize it, and execute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An existing network you can use immediately — not a list you hope to build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience structuring commercial deals and working through layered agency decision-making (holding companies, operating companies, local markets, specialist units)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation, communication, and presentation skills. Credible with a regional CEO and useful to a Business Director running a global brand the same week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of how media, creative, social, and performance agencies plan and buy in APAC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity, competing stakeholders, and a fast-moving product environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Southeast Asian language skills preferred — this will materially increase effectiveness in key markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time spent inside a holding-company network (WPP, Publicis, Omnicom, IPG, Dentsu, Havas) or a major independent, plus platform-side agency development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience standing up or resetting an agency partnership in a market where the platform was under-indexed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working fluency in how global brands brief regional and local agencies across SEA and India.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with both brand and performance agency models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
