&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in electrical engineering, power systems engineering, or a related field (civil, mechanical, or construction management with strong electrical experience also considered)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in electrical construction, power systems engineering, substations, data-center electrical infrastructure, BESS, or facilities electrical management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
