&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based at the Memphis, TN campus; travel across the site as needed and occasionally to other SpaceXSI or SpaceX locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to work extended hours and/or weekends as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to provide 24/7 on-call support for building emergencies and critical facility issues.&lt;/li&gt;
