&lt;p&gt;The Starlink Enterprise Sales team is hiring a results-driven Sr. Sales Manager to drive Starlink adoption across Canada. This role reports directly into the Enterprise Sales Director – Canada and will play a key part in building Starlink’s enterprise presence in the Canadian market. Starlink delivers high-performance connectivity with the power to transform Canada’s largest enterprises, critical infrastructure, and organizations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The primary focus of this role is large enterprise and Top Fortune accounts, with secondary coverage of SLED and government opportunities. The ideal candidate is a high-performing hunter who thrives in a greenfield environment, builds strong relationships with Canada’s largest enterprise organizations and ecosystems, and consistently wins complex deals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
