&lt;li&gt;Deliver compelling proposals and lead winning sales campaigns from first contact through close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with resellers, channel partners, and internal teams (including the Canada Director, product, market access, and support) to co-sell and expand opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate CRM hygiene, manage sales activity, and deliver weekly reports and quarterly business reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Starlink professionally in customer meetings, partner engagements, and industry events across Canada&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
