&lt;li&gt;Experience selling complex technology, connectivity, or telecommunications solutions into large enterprise / Top Fortune accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong existing relationships or experience working within Canada’s largest enterprise organizations and ecosystems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Canadian SLED (provincial, municipal, education) or government accounts as a secondary strength&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
