&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead facilities infrastructure projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with hand tools and power tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong prioritization and time management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment while maintaining attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
